    "after": "Following the edge of the Khumbu glacier, you reach Gorak Shep, the last settlement on the trail, beside a frozen lakebed. After lunch you walk on along the moraine to Everest Base Camp (5,364 m) at the foot of the Khumbu Icefall, where expedition tents gather in spring, before returning to Gorak Shep for the night."
