    "after": "The helicopter leaves Kathmandu at first light and flies along the Himalaya to Lukla to refuel, then up the Khumbu valley over Namche Bazaar and Tengboche to Everest Base Camp and the Khumbu glacier. When weather and rules allow, you land at Kala Patthar facing Everest for a few minutes of photographs. On the way back you stop for breakfast at Hotel Everest View, with Everest and Ama Dablam in view, before returning to Kathmandu by late morning."
