    "before": "Sundarijal about 1,460 m; separate Shivapuri NP fee.",
    "after": "A final walk through the forest of Shivapuri Nagarjun National Park, past Borlang Bhanjyang, down to Sundarijal at the edge of the Kathmandu valley, then a short drive to your hotel."
